},
},
linkback="block_00115",
linknext="block_00117",
},
block_00117={
{"quake",mode="mw"},
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“¡Sí, ya basta! ¡V-Vete a la habitación ya a hacer otra cosa! ¡Estás estorbando!”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00116",
linknext="block_00118",
},
block_00118={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"Alcé un poco la voz para reprenderla.",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00117",
linknext="block_00119",
},
block_00119={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"Kuzu respondió, sin cambiar ni un poco la expresión en su cara.",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00118",
linknext="block_00120",
},
block_00120={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1e0401",face="e0001",head="shz_z1e",lv=4,id=9},
{"fgact",ch="雫",act="うなづく",lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000062",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“Bueno.”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00119",
linknext="block_00121",
},
block_00121={
{"se",file="se9002",vol=50,id=1},
{"fg",ch="雫",mx=40,mode=-1,lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"Y tal como se lo ordené, se fue a la habitación de al lado.",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00120",
linknext="block_00122",
},
block_00122={
{"se",stop=1,time=500,id=1},
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"Creo que no era tan necesario gritarle...",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00121",
linknext="block_00123",
},
block_00123={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"Pero la vergüenza se acumuló tanto que terminé haciéndolo...",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00122",
linknext="block_00124",
},
block_00124={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“No pude evitarlo, a final de cuentas soy todavía un maldito virgen. No podía\naguantar más...”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00123",
linknext="block_00125",
},
block_00125={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"Soy del tipo que prefiere enamorarse de verdad, pero demonios... No estoy muy\nseguro de poder controlarme frente a semejante hermosura.",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00124",
linknext="block_00126",
},
block_00126={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"Soy un hombre de mucha razón, pero mi razón ante la belleza de esa muchacha es\ncomo un escudo antimotín frente a un misil antitanques...",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00125",
linknext="block_00127",
},
block_00127={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"Basta un impacto para perderla por completo.",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00126",
linknext="block_00128",
},
block_00128={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“Mierda...”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00127",
linknext="block_00129",
},
block_00129={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"Me dieron ganas de masturbarme, pero... no puedo hacerlo con una mujer dentro\nde la casa.",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00128",
linknext="block_00130",
},
block_00130={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“Aghhhh.”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00129",
linknext="block_00131",
},
block_00131={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"¿Es que ahora tendré que pasar mis días en celibato?",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00130",
linknext="block_00132",
},
block_00132={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“Por otro lado...”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00131",
linknext="block_00133",
},
block_00133={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"Observo la mano con la que toqué el hombro de Kuzu.",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00132",
linknext="block_00134",
},
block_00134={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“Realmente que son delgadas y frágiles las chicas...”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00133",
linknext="block_00135",
},
block_00135={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"Creo que ya entiendo un poco eso que dicen de que a las mujeres se les debe\ncuidar...",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00134",
linknext="block_00136",
},
block_00136={
{"mwact",act="びっくり"},
{"se",file="se9032",id=1},
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"¡Pero mucho más entiendo ahora lo excitante que puede ser una!",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00135",
linknext="block_00137",
},
block_00137={
{"bgm",stop=1,time=1000},
{"msgoff"},
{"bg",file="nightsky_spring",id=8,lv=8,sync=1,path=":cg/"},
{"ex",time=500,func="wait"},
{"bg",file="bluesky_winter",id=9,lv=9,sync=1,path=":cg/"},
{"bgm",file="bgm030"},
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“...”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00136",
linknext="block_00138",
},
block_00138={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“Hum...”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00137",
linknext="block_00139",
},
block_00139={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“Qué bien pude dormir anoche...”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00138",
linknext="block_00140",
},
block_00140={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"Entre tanta ansiedad pensé que no podría dormirme...",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00139",
linknext="block_00141",
},
block_00141={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"Aunque desperté ahora con una firme y dura erección matutina...",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00140",
linknext="block_00142",
},
block_00142={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“¿Mm?”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00141",
linknext="block_00143",
},
block_00143={
{"cgdel",id=-1},
{"msgoff"},
{"fg",mode=-2,sync=0},
{"bg",file="bg023a",path=":bg/",ax=960,ay=563,bx=0,by=-23,sync=0},
{"extrans",time=500},
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"¿Por qué será?...",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00142",
linknext="block_00144",
},
block_00144={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"Pensé que me sentía de maravilla por dormir tan bien, pero ahora que lo noto,\nsiento que la habitación está muy limpia...",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00143",
linknext="block_00145",
},
block_00145={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mx=40,mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1a0301",face="a0002",head="shz_z1a",lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000063",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“Buenos días.”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00144",
linknext="block_00146",
},
block_00146={
{"quake",mode="mw"},
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“¡Waah!”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00145",
linknext="block_00147",
},
block_00147={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1a0301",face="a0001",head="shz_z1a",lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000064",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“¿Te asusté?”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00146",
linknext="block_00148",
},
block_00148={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"Más que asustarme, no pude evitar alzar la voz ante su fresca, y un tanto\nexpuesta ropa.",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00147",
linknext="block_00149",
},
block_00149={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“Ah, no, solo me sorprendió lo temprano que te levantas...”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00148",
linknext="block_00150",
},
block_00150={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0003",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
delay={
vl01={
{"fgact",ch="雫",act="おじぎ",lv=4,id=9},
},
},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000065",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“Sí. Por eso los buenos días.”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00149",
linknext="block_00151",
},
block_00151={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“Quizás me estoy imaginando cosas, pero siento que la habitación está muy\nlimpia...”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00150",
linknext="block_00152",
},
block_00152={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0002",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000066",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“Porque limpié.”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00151",
linknext="block_00153",
},
block_00153={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“¿Eh? ¿Cuándo?”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00152",
linknext="block_00154",
},
block_00154={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0012",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000067",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“Hace un rato.”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00153",
linknext="block_00155",
},
block_00155={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“¿Hace un rato?”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00154",
linknext="block_00156",
},
block_00156={
{"bg",time=500,sync=0,file="black",path=":bg/"},
{"mwact",act="びっくり"},
{"se",file="se2766",id=1},
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"Me levanto e inspecciono todas las habitaciones.",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00155",
linknext="block_00157",
},
block_00157={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“¿P-Pero qué rayos? Todas las habitaciones están completamente limpias y\narregladas.”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00156",
linknext="block_00158",
},
block_00158={
{"msgoff"},
{"fg",mode=-2,sync=0},
{"bg",file="bg023a",path=":bg/",ax=960,ay=563,bx=0,by=-23,sync=0},
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0001",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9,sync=0},
{"extrans",time=500},
{"text"},
delay={
vl01={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1a0301",face="a0001",head="shz_z1a",lv=4,id=9},
},
},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000068",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“Kenichiro tampoco era muy bueno para organizar y limpiar su espacio, así que\nestoy ya acostumbrada a estas tareas. Y esto...”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00157",
linknext="block_00159",
},
block_00159={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1a0301",face="a0001",head="shz_z1a",lv=4,id=9},
{"fgact",ch="雫",act="うなづく",lv=4,id=9},
{"se",file="se9010",id=1},
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"Al decir eso, Kuzu me extendió un pequeño cuaderno.",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00158",
linknext="block_00160",
},
block_00160={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“¿Qué es esto?”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00159",
linknext="block_00161",
},
block_00161={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1a0301",face="a0002",head="shz_z1a",lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000069",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“Anoté todas las cosas que moví. Sería terrible que se perdiera algo, así que\nlas organicé por categoría. Si no encuentras algo puedes avisarme y lo\nbuscaré enseguida.”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00160",
linknext="block_00162",
},
block_00162={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“Pues, debo admitir que es genial que esté todo limpio ahora, pero...\n¿En qué momento dormiste?”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00161",
linknext="block_00163",
},
block_00163={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1a0301",face="a0001",head="shz_z1a",lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000070",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“No tienes por qué preocuparte por eso.”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00162",
linknext="block_00164",
},
block_00164={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“¿Que no debo preocuparme? Por lo menos una noche entera necesitaría alguien\npara limpiar todo ese desastre.”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00163",
linknext="block_00165",
},
block_00165={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"Y además, fue una limpieza de gran escala. ¿Cómo es que no me desperté?",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00164",
linknext="block_00166",
},
block_00166={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0001",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
{"fgact",ch="雫",act="うなづく",lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000071",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“Tienes razón. Aunque tengo algo mucho más importante que debo reportar ahora.”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00165",
linknext="block_00167",
},
block_00167={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“¿Algo que reportar?”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00166",
linknext="block_00168",
},
block_00168={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0011",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000072",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“Debes dejar la masturbación contra suelo.”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00167",
linknext="block_00169",
},
block_00169={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“¡¿P-Por qué sacas ese tema tan repentinamente?!”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00168",
linknext="block_00170",
},
block_00170={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0005",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
{"fgact",ch="雫",act="うなづく",lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
delay={
vl01={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0008",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
},
},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000073",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“Ayer, después de regresar a la habitación investigué, y llegué a la conclusión\nde que no es bueno para ti. Te recomiendo que satisfagas tus necesidades\nsexuales de una manera adecuada.”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00169",
linknext="block_00171",
},
block_00171={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“P-Por qué...”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00170",
linknext="block_00172",
},
block_00172={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0001",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000074",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“Naoya, anoche sueños eróticos atormentaban tu sueño, así que lo chupé todo.”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00171",
linknext="block_00173",
},
block_00173={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“¿No podía dormir bien por esos sueños? ¿Y por eso chupaste todo? ¿Eh? ¡¿A-A qué\ndiablos te refieres con eso?!”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00172",
linknext="block_00174",
},
block_00174={
{"bgm",stop=1,time=500},
{"fg",mode=-2},
{"cgact",stage="bg023",act="うなづく"},
{"se",file="se0897s",id=1},
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"No dudé ni un segundo en revisar el interior de mis calzoncillos.",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00173",
linknext="block_00175",
},
block_00175={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"No parece haber ningún rastro de suciedad.",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00174",
linknext="block_00176",
},
block_00176={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"¿Será que lo limpió todo con la lengua?",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00175",
linknext="block_00177",
},
block_00177={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"No, de ninguna manera. Hasta yo despertaría de un brinco si me llegaran a hacer\neso.",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00176",
linknext="block_00178",
},
block_00178={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
"Además, no recuerdo haber visto ningún sueño así ayer, y mis partes no lucen\ncomo si algo hubiera pasado.",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00177",
linknext="block_00179",
},
block_00179={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1a0301",face="a0001",head="shz_z1a",lv=4,id=9},
{"bgm",file="bgm007"},
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“Mi zona inferior no parece estar sucia en absoluto... ¡¿T-Tú, q-qué me\nhiciste?!”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00178",
linknext="block_00180",
},
block_00180={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0001",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
delay={
vl01={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0008",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
},
},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000075",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“Exactamente lo que acabo de decir. Aunque debo admitir que me costó tragarlo\ntodo...”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00179",
linknext="block_00181",
},
block_00181={
{"mwact",act="びっくり",size=5},
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“¡¿Tragar?! ¡Claro, así que era eso!”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00180",
linknext="block_00182",
},
block_00182={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0001",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000076",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“¿Mmm?”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00181",
linknext="block_00183",
},
block_00183={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“N-No me vengas con esa cara de no saber nada... C-Chupaste mi pene, ¿verdad?”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00182",
linknext="block_00184",
},
block_00184={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0013",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
{"fgact",ch="雫",act="びっくり",time=100,size=7,lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000077",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“¿Eh?”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00183",
linknext="block_00185",
},
block_00185={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“E-Estás diciendo que chupaste, y tragaste...”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00184",
linknext="block_00186",
},
block_00186={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0011",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
{"fgact",ch="雫",act="びっくり",time=100,size=7,lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
delay={
vl01={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0009",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
},
},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000078",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“E-Esto, ¿quieres decir que, hubiese sido mejor hacer eso?”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00185",
linknext="block_00187",
},
block_00187={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“No, no, ¿es que no lo hiciste con la boca? ¿Fue con la mano entonces? ¿Me\nhiciste una paja?”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00186",
linknext="block_00188",
},
block_00188={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0008",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
{"fgact",ch="雫",act="icon",lv=4,id=9,icon="icon02z1",x=40,y=-550},
{"text"},
delay={
vl01={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0001",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
},
vl02={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0002",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
{"fgact",ch="雫",act="ud",lv=4,id=9},
},
},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000079",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“¿Una paja?... Una paja... paja...”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00187",
linknext="block_00189",
},
block_00189={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“¡Egh, no te pongas a buscar todo lo que digo en el teléfono!”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00188",
linknext="block_00190",
},
block_00190={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0001",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
delay={
vl01={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0013j",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
{"fgact",ch="雫",act="びっくり",lv=4,id=9},
},
},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000080",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“¿Pa, ja?!”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00189",
linknext="block_00191",
},
block_00191={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0018j",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
{"fgact",ch="雫",act="うなづく",lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
delay={
vl01={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1b0301",face="b0009j",head="shz_z1b",lv=4,id=9},
},
},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000081",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“*Ejem*, acabo de entender lo que es una paja... B-Bien, así que deseas que te\nhaga eso todas las noches de ahora en adelante...”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00190",
linknext="block_00192",
},
block_00192={
{"text"},
text={
ja={
{
name={"Naoya"},
"“¡No, no es eso! ¡¿De qué estabas hablando entonces?! ¡Tragar, tragar, no\nentiendo qué diablos tragaste!”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00191",
linknext="block_00193",
},
block_00193={
{"fg",ch="雫",size="z1",mode=3,path=":fg/shz/z1/",file="shz_z1a0301",face="a0001",head="shz_z1a",lv=4,id=9},
{"text"},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_kzd_000082",ch="kzd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Kuzu"},
"“¿Ah, eso? Con tragar me refiero a esto...”",
{"rt2"},
},
},
},
linkback="block_00192",
linknext="block_00194",
},
block_00194={
